WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.370
...crazy about you!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.260
Let me hug you.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.260
W-

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.260
What are you, an idiot!?
There's no way I'd let you-

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:54.600
Hey, keep back! If you come any closer,
I'm gonna slug you!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.190
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:11.430
"'Clash! Sudden Death of Love"'

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:19.430
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:27.880
What happened the other day...
it really hit me hard... with a wallop.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.690
You know something?

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:37.360
Momo-chan, when you're with Toji,
you have the most fantastic smile.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:40.360
I really like that smile.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.700
Unfortunately, I'm not able to
get that kind of smile out of you.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.400
Momo-chan, always smile.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:51.500
Okayasu...

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:59.100
Well, good luck in the rest of your races.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:11.180
W- why is my heart
beating faster over that guy?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.330
Adachi!

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.670
--Where are you wandering off to!?
--The race is about to start, you know!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.000
--What are you doing!?
--Hurry up!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.340
Girls 100m relay, take your marks.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.340
Listen, you're our anchor.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:28.680
Show us all the ability
of an ex-swim team member this time!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.010
Hey, are you listening to me!?

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.680
Huh? Yeah...

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.350
That Adachi is making me uneasy.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.350
She's got no hustle at all.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.980
I'm sorry.

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:41.290
It's my fault.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:45.030
Why are you apologizing, Sae-chan?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:49.360
Apparently, Momo-chan doesn't like
how everyone has been siding with me.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.370
So she must be trying to get back at us.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.560
Then, she's losing on purpose!?

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.370
What's her problem!? She's the one
who started all this, isn't she!?

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.280
Yeah! She's the one
who tried using dirty tricks

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.650
to come between Sae-chan and Toji,
after all!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.310
Oh? What kind of tricks?

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:09.990
Don't you know? As soon as
I'm not around, she closes in on Toji!

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:13.220
She barged in on us at the hospital,
and yelled that she'd jump out the window

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.880
if he didn't go out with her!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:22.000
That's funny. That's quite different
from the story I know.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.330
Say, did you know that
Toji's girlfriend is actually...

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.000
Oh, no! Okayasu, you look pale!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.100
Let's get you to the nurse's office!

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.980
The sensation from
Okayasu's arms is still there.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:46.020
That pervert! What gives with
the ''Let me hug you''!?

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.820
And when l'm at my most immodest,
of all times!

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.030
Still...

00:04:55.030 --> 00:05:00.700
To tell the truth, l'm a little relieved.
lt turns out he really was worried about me.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:04.940
l've been presuming on Okayasu.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:07.640
Before l knew it,
l've come to rely on him.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.980
Somewhere inside me,
l wanted him to care about me,

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:12.710
so when he hugged me, l didn't fight back.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:20.990
What am l thinking!? lt's almost
as though l like Okayasu, isn't it!?

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:24.330
Here they come, neck-and-neck!
The race is between the anchors now!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:27.120
l didn't know. Am l...

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.820
...the easily-swayed type!?

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.000
Come to that place we were
before in 30 minutes.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.500
l'll have something
even more amazing to show you.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.640
l'm breaking up with you!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.350
Wait up, Okayasu!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.350
No way!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:57.310
I'm just warning you, it won't do any good
to try telling everyone about me.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.360
Why not?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:05.630
If you do that, I'll go crying to the teacher,
saying that you were beating up on me!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.300
You won't be able to stay in school
any longer! Is that what you want!?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.240
Oh, I'm so scared!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:18.680
All right, all right! I give up! I won't
say anything against you, Sae-chan,

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.320
so forgive me!

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.550
Though you know, I've been
thinking this for some time now,

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:25.650
but Sae-chan, your brain really works fast!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.660
I'm not sure if you play it by ear,
or if you're just really perceptive,

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.990
but the guys in 3rd Class have fallen
spectacularly under your mind control, huh?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.730
How are you able to make everyone
believe you like that?

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.430
Come on, come on, tell me, tell me!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.670
It's simple.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.210
What would you think
if you saw a lion in front of you,

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:48.010
and next to it was a wounded deer
down on the ground?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:52.350
Well, I would think that it had been
mauled by the lion, and feel sorry for it.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:56.650
Well, what if me and Momo-chan
were together, and I was crying?

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:02.620
It's the same thing. The idea is,
whoever cries first wins.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:07.300
People are such that everyone thinks
whoever looks weaker is the victim.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:11.670
The truth is, when I said that Momo-chan
was trying to steal my Toji away,

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.640
nobody doubted me.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:18.310
On the contrary, they all said that it
seemed like something Adachi would do.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:23.140
Everyone only sees
what's on the surface. Even Toji.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.680
I get it.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.980
No wonder you've been able to lead
Momo-chan and me around by the nose.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.320
That's Sae-chan for you!
As an actress, you're a cut above!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.660
Aw, if only I were as smart
as you are, Sae-chan.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:36.990
I don't think there's anyone in school

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.330
who's as sharp-witted as you are,
Sae-chan.

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:42.230
On top of that, you're cute...
and stylish, too,

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.100
so I can turn a blind eye
to your small personality flaws.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.930
Here's to the greatest femme fatale
in all of Japan!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:54.640
Still, it's not going to work.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:58.680
Sae-chan, your reign is over.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.620
After all, Toji should be
getting out of the hospital.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.620
Once he denies that
you're his girlfriend, Sae-chan,

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:08.620
then all of the lies you've told
will come to light, one by one.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.630
You're such a dupe.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.290
Once the swim meet is over,
it's summer vacation.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:16.300
All I have to do is make Toji mine
in the meantime, and I've got it made.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.630
Oh, I should have known!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:22.640
Now, you listen to me! Don't you
hang around me anymore, got it?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:28.670
Right! In return, don't pick on
Momo-chan too much, okay? Bye-bye!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.980
Hear that?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.380
That's who Sae-chan really is.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.320
Any thoughts?

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.330
You're the one who's mistaken, Toji!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.330
Why won't you believe what I say,
but you will believe what Sae says!?

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:52.370
What planet is it where guys
use other girls to practice kissing on

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.000
for when they kiss their girlfriends!?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.100
I didn't think you were that stupid, Toji!
I've misjudged you! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.570
Adachi...

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:15.290
What's the matter?
Did our class lose again?

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.290
No, actually...

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:21.630
Here are the results of this race:
in first place, 1st Year 3rd Class.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:24.390
We've won the last three in a row.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:29.670
The current leader in the 50m freestyle
is 1st Year 3rd Class.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.970
So fast! She's way out in front!

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.310
1st Year 3rd Class comes in first again!

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.310
What's going on with Adachi?

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.980
It's almost as though
she's a different person!

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.310
Amazing!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:40.650
Adachi-san, good luck!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.650
Cool!

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:42.980
She's amazing, huh?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.320
I've gotta give her credit!

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.320
That's the truth!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:49.480
Who was it that said
she was losing on purpose?

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.330
O- Okada!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.520
Who threw that thing!?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:01.340
That's not fair, 3rd Class!
Having a ringer swim all of your races!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:04.010
Hey, that's the same girl, right?
The one that was in the locker room?

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.340
Huh? What?

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:10.350
The one who was hugging a boy?
And without any clothes on, at that?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.350
Who? Who? Who was the boy?

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.350
Okayasu Kairi, from 4th Class.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.350
You're kidding! So those two
really are together?

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:20.020
Yes, yes! The locker room door was open!

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.990
I knew it!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:30.030
"'Cafeteria"'

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:31.700
Hey there, MVP!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:32.700
Good luck!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:35.040
Good luck, Adachi!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.610
This feels so weird.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:41.740
l was just swimming like crazy
to keep from thinking about Okayasu.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.270
You sure have increased your stock, huh?

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:55.390
I heard about you giving Okayasu
a hug in your skivvies.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:58.120
I wish I could have seen that.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.660
You sure get around, huh?
You've just barely broken up with Toji,

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.330
and you've already moved on
to Okayasu, is that it?

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.670
You know, Momo-chan,
you sure have unusual tastes.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.440
What do you see in that womanizer,

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.130
who seems to always have
his mind in the gutter?

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:18.310
They say that he has never seriously
gone out with anyone up to now,

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:19.350
don't they?

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.680
He's just going to fool around
with you, and then dump you.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:24.690
After all, from the looks of him,
Okayasu is a lightweight,

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.450
who's easily flattered,
but has nothing on the inside,

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.360
and is just the bottom
of the barrel, you know?

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:31.690
Sure, he may have a nice face,
but that's all there is to him, isn't it?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.350
Oh! Unless, you're into him for his looks?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:12:00.550
You don't know anything!
You don't know anything about Okayasu!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:08.330
Toji, you've never been around a girl
of Sae-chan's type before, huh?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.100
You didn't have any immunity to her.

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:12.670
That's why you were
so completely taken in by her.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.300
I'm sure you've been blessed
with family and friends, huh?

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.670
Toji?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:23.680
I can't do it. I can't face Adachi.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.580
What are you talking-

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.690
--Sae-chan!
--What's wrong?

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:38.690
I didn't even do anything,
but Momo-chan... Momo-chan...

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.700
You did so! Maybe he is a perv,
and does lots of dumb things,

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:44.370
but Okayasu has many good points, too!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:47.370
He's a much better person
than you are, at least!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.700
H- how mean!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.860
How mean!

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:56.040
Hey, Adachi! I don't know what's going on,
but you didn't have to hit her!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.650
Yeah! We're all disgusted with you about
what you've done to Sae-chan and Toji,

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:02.580
but you were so great during the races,

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.650
we forgot about it for the time being
and cheered you on, you know!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:08.660
And then you had to go and shatter that!

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.320
Yeah! Apologize to Kashiwagi!

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:11.330
Yeah! Yeah!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:15.000
Put your hands together and apologize
to Kashiwagi for everything you've done!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.330
Bow down on the floor! Do it now, Adachi!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.670
Excuse me, let me through.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.340
Hurry it up! What are you doing!?

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:24.670
Why should I have to apologize?

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:27.340
What are you talking about!
You hit her as hard as you could!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:31.350
Poor girl! Sae-chan's face is
starting to swell up, you know!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:36.680
Aw, man! This is no good! It's an
absolute lion and deer situation.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.690
Is this any time to be saying that!?
We have to help her!

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:40.350
Now, hold on.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:42.020
I have a plan.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.130
Where are you planning on going, Okayasu?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.320
We've got to stop them fast,
or Adachi is going to be...

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.700
Oh, there it is.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.600
Hey, what are you thinking
of doing with that?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.190
Yay! You fell for it, dummy!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.310
You're dreaming if you
think you can show up now

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.640
and take away all the tasty goodness.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:07.320
Don't worry though,
I'm going to rescue Momo-chan.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.580
Momo-chan is going to be so impressed!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:13.990
After all, right now,
I'm the only friend Momo-chan has.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.990
She might actually fall for me for real!

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:21.000
Sorry about this, Toji.
Momo-chan is all mine.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.000
H- hey! You dumbass, Okayasu!
Wait the hell up! Let me out of here!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.400
That's what you get
for making Momo-chan cry.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:30.000
Let's see just how serious
you are about her, Toji.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.670
Move! Let me go!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:37.680
What's your problem!?
This matter is between me and Sae!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:41.620
Sae, if you've got something
to say to me, I'm listening!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.350
Let's have this out, just you and me!

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:45.820
Easy for you to say!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.690
Once it's just the two of us,
you're just going to hit me again, right?

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.420
That's what you always do, isn't it?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.030
Is that true? You're awful!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:58.520
--Did you hear that just now?
That chick is always hitting her?
--What a bitch!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:06.070
lt's no use. Anything l do
will play into Sae's hand.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:11.980
Hey, you guys! You have my permission!
Make that chick kneel down!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:25.990
Kneel her down! Kneel her down!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:29.000
Sae, this is wrong!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.330
You may be able to
strut around proudly now,

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:35.000
but if you keep doing this, before long,
no one is going to want to be with you!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.670
You're the one that nobody
is going to want to be with!

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.010
Apologize!

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:43.310
Swear to her that you'll never
do anything like this again!

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:49.680
Damned if l'm going to apologize!

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:53.350
--Not... not for this!
--Check her out.
--She's one stubborn chick.

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:56.120
No way am l going to apologize!

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.370
Toji?

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.310
Toji!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.810
I thought you were in the hospital!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:30.920
No... l can't bear to have
Toji see me like this...

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.670
Move!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.330
Move your hands!

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:58.690
So much that l can't
express it very well...

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:07.960
so much that l can't believe it...

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.300
l become so uneasy.
Shut up!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:10.970
l become so uneasy.
Adachi is my girlfriend!

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:17.640
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:23.980
Where can we go

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:33.320
where we can all be

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.320
under the same sky?
Momo-chan has been
hugging Okayasu again.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:44.650
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:54.680
l feel like l'm being crushed,

00:17:54.680 --> 00:18:00.950
struggling for all l'm worth

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:07.290
to keep myself from whimpering

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:15.300
before the stars are blurred by my tears.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:21.640
No matter how hard things might be,

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:27.980
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:35.320
l just wish that l could be

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:42.620
someone with that kind of courage.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.660
What's going on?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:49.660
This is completely different
from what we heard.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:53.330
If Toji and Adachi were seeing each other,
what does that make Sae-chan?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:58.010
But come to think of it, we never heard
Toji say anything bad about Adachi, huh?

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:00.610
We always heard it from Sae-chan.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.280
So what does that mean?

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.040
Sae-chan was the one who was lying?

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.280
How cruel, Toji! You can't do this to me!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.950
You said you and Momo-chan
were through, didn't you?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.320
You kissed me,
and made me fall for you!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:19.290
Were you lying
when you said you loved me!?

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:25.630
Those two are both to blame! You should
feel sorry for me! I'm the victim here!

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.640
How about giving it a rest already?

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.430
You're just disgracing yourself
by carrying on any further.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.640
W- what?

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:39.650
You haven't changed at all,
huh, Kashiwagi Sae?

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.980
Remember us?

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.650
Oh, you can't say you've forgotten us!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.520
--We've all had our boyfriends
--We've all had our boyfriends
--We've all had our boyfriends

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:49.490
--stolen away from us by you!
--stolen away from us by you!
--stolen away from us by you!

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:56.000
That's not true! That's not true...
Right? You all believe me, right?

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:00.330
Y- you think I would do such a thing? Huh?

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.670
Once, when I asked you out
on a date, Sae-chan,

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:07.680
you said I should check a mirror and
guess again, and then tore up my tickets.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:11.010
Don't be ridiculous, you Cro-Magnon!

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:13.410
Hear that? You heard that, right?

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.020
You said you were afraid
because Adachi was bullying you,

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:20.690
so that's why you asked us to teach her
a lesson, huh? That was a lie, too.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.360
N- no!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.350
We're sorry, Adachi.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.360
Sorry we had it all wrong.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:32.030
--Sorry.
--We've been idiots.

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:35.040
W- wait, everyone...

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:39.900
It's not like that! I didn't do
anything wrong! I did nothing wrong!

00:20:56.390 --> 00:21:00.060
You did it, Momo-chan! You won big!

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.930
Hey, Toji, you took your time
coming to rescue her!

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:05.330
I was worried sick
you wouldn't make it in time.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.100
Okayasu! Why, you!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.730
Good luck together, you two.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:24.680
Sorry about earlier. It happened so fast,
and I lied about you being my girlfriend.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.690
Adachi...

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:38.030
I know it's a lot to ask,
coming from me after all this,

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.030
but can we start over?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.030
You and me, once again?

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.710
Toji...

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.660
I really am sorry.

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:08.660
It's because I was such a fool
that you got hurt so badly, Adachi.

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:14.000
Mm-mm, I'm the one who should be
sorry for saying such terrible things.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.970
We can start over, right?

00:22:37.030 --> 00:22:43.030
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.030 --> 00:22:52.710
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:55.710
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.710 --> 00:23:02.320
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:08.660
Where can we go

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:18.340
where we can all be

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:21.000
under the same sky?

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:29.350
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:36.020
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:42.360
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:49.700
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.700 --> 00:23:57.730
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:03.650
Say, Toji, how about we come up
with our own little sign?

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:07.650
For example, what if we make an ''L''
with our fingers that means ''love''?

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:12.320
Huh? No? Never mind! Toji, you just
don't understand how l feel!

00:24:12.320 --> 00:24:15.310
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'A Fleeting Love Sign"'
